    "name": "Handmade Cedar Catch-All Tray – Rustic Ring Dish & Coin Holder",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Add a touch of nature to your nightstand or entryway with this rustic catch-all tray. Meticulously crafted from solid, aromatic cedar 4x4 timber, this sturdy holder is perfect for keeping your rings, jewelry, keys, or loose change organized in one beautiful place.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Material: 100% Solid Cedar wood (showcasing natural grain and warm tones).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Finish: Sealed with durable polyurethane to protect against daily wear and moisture.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Dimensions: Roughly 4\" x 4\" x 4\" (Perfect for small spaces).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Features: Natural, rustic, and handcrafted.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Note: Due to the nature of wood, each piece will have unique grain patterns and natural characteristics.</span></p>",
